WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.550
Rise.

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:04.125
Bring your whole life before God.

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:06.562
Name the calling you will answer.

00:00:06.562 --> 00:00:08.875
Choose the good you will do today.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.838
Lay down the habit that holds you captive.

00:00:11.838 --> 00:00:15.750
Ask the Father, through Jesus Christ, for strength.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.388
Then take the next faithful step.

00:00:18.388 --> 00:00:20.112
Serve someone.

00:00:20.112 --> 00:00:21.838
Keep your word.

00:00:21.838 --> 00:00:24.675
Plant something good in the garden each day.

00:00:24.675 --> 00:00:26.812
Commit your life to God.

00:00:26.812 --> 00:00:29.175
Put your faith into action.

00:00:29.175 --> 00:00:30.788
Begin now.
